<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">ROM-BUU</book>
  <para style="h">ROM ROM-BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">ROM ROM-BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">ROM ROM-BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">ROM ROM-BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROM ROM-BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Imbe nyi zhu ri ame Bulus, ivren ko Kristo Yeso nga nji ri bla tre Izhi riwa Izhi chu wen ritu me bla tre wan ri ndindi.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Itre ri ro-a Izhi a kadzi zhu ri sen hu ri nyun wa la tre wan ri kusi riwa a he rimi mbe Izhi ri Tsitsri. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />A he ritu vren, Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo: bibi riwa kpa wa ngɨzhi-u ri gran Doda nye; <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />ama ritu tsitsri wan ri wu, ritu gbengbren wan a tsro ri a he vren Izhi nye riwa a tashime ri bubu gru. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Ritu Kristo nye Izhi no wen gbengbren ri he nji ri la tre wan ritu Kristo, ritu meri tsro nji wa mgbumgblume no wa kpanyime wari hu tre wan. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Rinyi he ritu mbi ngawen wawa bi he ri Roma, wawa Izhi yo yi no yi he wa Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Ngha me ngan ri wawu mbi wawa bi he ri Roma wawa Izhi nyime yi ran yo yi no yi he wa nji wan</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">No A ti mbu nga Bachi Yeso Kristo no yi ndindi ti wan nga sisron.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bre ri Ngɨri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Ri mimilan, me ngɨri ri Izhi won hu ri Yeso Kristo ritu mbi wawu, ritu mgbumgblume wawu ri wo ritu yosron mbi. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Izhi to bibi riwa me sondu ri ibreritu mbi. Bla vi bla mbɨre me sondu bre Izhi ritu mbi nga kyawa riwa bi wa, Izhi riwa me hu ri sron riri meri ri vɨra tre ndindi ritu vren wan, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />ri ibrewon bla vi, me bre Izhi rimi nyime sron wan, no no wen nkon me ye to yi zizan. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Me wa meri ye to yi ritu meri no yi de ri wu riwa ari no yi senkpa. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Me tre ritu haha mbu iwayi ki ri dzon ngambu, biyi ri yosron won nga ame ri yosron mbi. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Biyi miri vayi wa hu Izhi me wa bi ri taka ri imkpa kigbu me kadzi ri me ye son ri yi meri kɨma sron mbi no Kristo, ama ikyari ri sondu dzu wen ri ye. Me wa meri fe wawa wa ka sron mba no Izhi bibi riwa me fe rimi wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ritu haki kongaa he ri tu won, wawa wa he rimi nchon gbu nga wawa wa he ri vi gbu, wawa wa he ri wiwiri nga wawa wa ran he ri wiwiri ran. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ritu wan nye me yo sron meri la yi tre ri ro-a ri yi wawa bi he ri gbu Roma-a ngawen.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgbemgbren Tre Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Itre ri ro nyi ran he kya ri shan ri mo ran; a he gbengbren Izhi nye riwa ari kpa kongaa riwa a kpanyime, ri mimɨlan ari he nji Yahuda nga ri hari wan ri he wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ritu tre ri ro-a nye tsro bibi riwa Izhi ri no ta ki ti tsra ri wawu: a he ritu yosron nye zhu ri mimɨlan hi ri kre wan. Bibi riwa imbe Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Inji riwa ari ti ndindi ti ri yosron nye ri fe vɨri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ko ngaa he ri Memeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Ifu Izhi zhu ri shu mu ye ritu wawa wa ti meme ti riwa meme ti mba a chan kpunji ran no nji ran to-u ran. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Izhi ri no wa yaa, ritu ikya riwa wa to ritu Izhi a he ri wa ri rira, ritu Izhi kyuwan nye ka-u yo wa ri rira. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Tu riwa Izhi a ti mgbumgblume, nji wa to meme nga shuwulu, Hu ri kya riwa Izhi ti wa. Ri ngamba wa nji-a wa ran he ri kya ri tre ri wawa wa ran to-u ran. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Wa to Izhi, ama wana ri no mkpen riwa a he wa ma-a ran, ko no wa ngɨri ri wu. Tsede, irimɨren mba he ri kuklu, nga sron mba riwa a ran ri rimɨren ran a ti bu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Wa tre ri wa he ri wiwiri, ama wa he wa mkpiran; <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />riwa no wa gbre Izhi riwa ari vɨri, wa kɨma ri gbre Izhi riwa wa he ka nji,wari ka chenchen nga wari ka inɨma wa ji ko kyawa wa gbran ri meme. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ritu ngamba nye Izhi kɨma gon ti wa ri meme mbiye ri sron mba, nga kpa mba wa ti kyawa ri shan ri wu ri ngamba. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Wa sran kpunji tre ri che ritu Izhi; wa gbre nga wari ri hu kya riwa Izhi ti, memeko Izhi kyuwan, riwa a he riwa wa gbre wu hi ri kre! No he ngamba. <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ritu wa ti nganyi, Izhi kɨma gon ti wa no mbye mba ri shan-a. Wa mbaa mba riwa wa kru ri ronron wa kɨma ri kru ngamba mbaa riwa a ran tsra ran. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ri ngamba me wa ronron wa kru ngamba ronron, nga ritu ngamba wa ngɨzhi yaa ri ye ri ngamba ritu meme ti mba riwa wa ti. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Ritu wa kamba ri to Izhi, a kɨma gon ti wa no wa ti meme ti riwa a ran bi no wa ti ran. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Isron mba sho ri meme sron, meme ti, imbɨye, ɨuu, riwu nji, iwanyun, igyuru. Wa he wa bla mmu, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />nga wa ri tre tre meme ritu ngamba, wa he kpanfu Izhi, wa he wa kra tu, wa ndzutu, Wa wa nkon riwa wa ti meme ti kakre; wa ran ri hu tre wa ti mba ran; <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />wa ran he ri tu ran, wa ran ri ti kya riwa wa kadzi ri wa ti ran, nga wa ran ri losron ri ngamba ran. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Wa to rimi doka Izhi ri wawa wa ti bibi nyi wa kuu. Ama wa kamba bru ri ti bibi kyawa wamba, hari wa ri ri shogon wari ritu no wa ti bibi wan ngawen.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ibla tre Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />A wu kpan won, wu bla tre ri wari ritu meme ti riwa wa ti ama a wu wu ti meme ti-a ngawen, ri ngamba wu ran he ri nyu ri tre ran. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Ki to ri ibla tre Izhi ri wawa wa ti nganyi a tsra. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ama a wu, ikpan won wu ti kya riwa wu bla tre ri wari riti wan a wu tomba ko wu jɨbu ri bla tre Izhi? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Ahe riwa wu to bibi riwa bibi reree, ikachuwo nga vusron. Wu ran to bibi reree Izhi-a ran, ritu ari wa wuri kɨmagon ti meme ti wen. <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ama wu he ri kpekpe nga mgbimgbi sron nga fu Izhi ri chachu riwa wa nghɨran yaa riwa a he rimi ndindi ti riwa Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Riti Izhi ri bla tre ri kongaa ritu bibi kya riwa a ti. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Inji wari wa sondu ri ti kyawa wa ndindi, nga wari wa gbre riwa Izhi, nga wari no Izhi mkpen nga, wari son son ri ndindi, bibi nji wanyi wa fe viri riwa a ran kre ran.<verse eid="ROM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Wari wa nyime tu mba wari kamba ri kya riwa a tsra ritu no wa hu kya riwa a ran tsra ran Izhi ri chu nchon fu wan sro ri wa. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Iyaa nga lo ri he ri wawa wa ti meme ti wa gbuchi ri wa nji Yahuda ri ko wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ama Izhi ri de gbre, ri mkpen nga sisron ri wawa wa ti kya ndindi, ari gbuchi no wa nji Yahuda ri ko ran no wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ama Izhi ri bla tre bibi riri ri ko ngaa.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Wawa Wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran wa ran he ri doka Musa ran wa kuu wa ran to doka Musa ran, wa kuu wa ran to doka ran wa nji Yahuda wa to doka wa ti meme ti nga wa bla tre ri wa ri doka. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Aran he wawa wa to doka Izhi nye wa he wa ndiditi kusi Izhi ran, ama wawa wa ti kya riwa doka Izhi tre. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran wa ran to doka Izhi ran, ama chachu riwa wa ti kya riwa doka Izhi tre no wa ti, rimba he doka mba nye mba ko ri riwa wa ran to doka ran. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Iti mba tsro ri ikya riwa doka tre no wa ti he ri ngan ri sron mba, isron mba ngawen tsro ri a he kpunji ari ye isron mba ka lawa ri wa ti meme ti. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Ritu ngamba bibi riwa itsro ri ro riwa me tsro-a nganyi nye ari he chachu mba riwa hu ri Yeso Kristo Izhi ri bla rimiren ri yayibi iwawu.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa Nji Yahuda nga Doka Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />A wu fa? Wu yo ngawen ri wu he nji Yahuda wu yo sron ri doka nga wuri ri kpo ngawen ri Izhi; <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Wu to kya riwa Izhi ri wa no ti nga wuri to rimi doka ikya riwa a tsra; <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Wuto ri wu he nji ri tsro wa mfyen nkon wu he kpan wawa wa he ri bu, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />wu tsro wawa wa ran to kyari ran, nga wu he nji ri tsro wawa wa rimɨren ka miri, wu to ri rimi doka Musa nye wu to kpunji. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Wu tsro wari ko wu ti rise ko wu ran tsro ngawen ran? Wu tsro ri, &lt;&lt;Ran yibi ran&gt;&gt; Ko ritu ngye a wu wu yibi? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Wu tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ran kru mba nji ran.&gt;&gt;Wu ran ri kru mba nji ran? Wu kawen ri wa tranga ama wu ran ri yibi rimi wa tranga ran? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Wu kpongawen ritu wu he ri doka Izhi, ama wu no Izhi shan wuri ran ri hu doka wan ran. <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ritu ngamba nye imbe Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ritu mbi wa nji Yahuda nye wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran wa tre tre meme ritu Izhi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />I wu hu tre Izhi, ifon nju wen tsra, ama i wu kawen ri hu tre wan ari he ka wana fon wu nju ran. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />I nji riwa a ran he nji Yahuda a hu doka Izhi ko wa ran fon wu nju ran Izhi ran kpaa ran? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ngha biyi wa nji Yada wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ran nye wa wuu yi ritu bi ran hu doka ran, kau ri riwa wa ngan ri sron mbi mba nga wari fon yi nju. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Kugon kre wan ingaa nye he nji Yahuda ri kpunji ri wa wa fon nju? Aran he nji riwa a he nji Yahuda ri raa ran riwa ifon nji wan he rirana. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ama nji Yahuda ri Kpunji he nji riwa ari ti kya riwa Izhi ri nyime, nga ifon nju ri kpunji ran he ritu kya riwa wa ngha rimi doka ran, a he ritu sran sron nye ritu ndu wu Izhi. Bibi nji-a ri fe gbre ri Izhi a ran ri nji ran.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Ringye nye wa nji Yahuda wa han wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran? Ingye nye he bi wan rimi fon nji? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />A he bran ri ko ri nkon ritan ri mimilan wa nji Yahuda nye wawa Izhi ritu wan nye a ka tre wan-a riwa a he wa Izhi ka no wa no wa milan ya. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ama i wari mba wa ran he ri yosron ran fa? Rimba ri tsro ri Izhi ran he ri kpunji ran? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Aran he ngamba ran! ko wari tre ri nji wawu wa ti che Izhi ran ran ri ti che ran. Bibi riwa imbe Izhi tre ri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;&lt;Wu tsro ri wu tre wuka tsro ri wu tre tsra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">wuka han gbengbren ko ngaa i wa miyen tre ritu wen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ama ari he ri se i meme ti mbu tsro ndindi ti bibi riwa Izhi he? ki tre ri Izhi ran ti tsra ran ka a no ta yaa? me tre bibi riwa nji ri tre nye. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Aran ngamba ran! Ran he ngamba Izhi ri ti se ran bla tre ri nji mgbumglume?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Ama i meme ti won no ndindi ti nkpen Izhi zhu ri rira, ari he ri se? Ritu ngye ko wa bla tre rimo ritu me he nji ri meme ti? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Ritu ngye ko ki ran tre ri,&lt;&lt;No ta ki ran ti meme ti bibi riwa no Izhi no ye ran?&gt;&gt; Inji wari wa tre tre ri kpande time, ri ngamba nye me tre wa no wa yaa bibi riwa a tsro no wa ti riwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inji wawu wa he wa meme ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Ko ka kita wa nji Yahuda ki han wawa wa ran he wan nji Yahuda ran? Aran he ngamba ran ki gbu chi tsro-e ri wa nji Yahuda ran, wa ti meme ti nga wa he ri ndodza gbengbren meme.<verse eid="ROM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Bibi riwa Imbe Izhi tre ri</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">&lt;&lt;Injo ran he riwa a ti ndindi ti ran,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Injo ran he ri wiwiri ran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">ko injo ran gbre Izhi ran<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Ko ngaa kɨma gon ti Izhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">wawu mba wa ran ti tsra ran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Ko njo ri mba ran ti tsra ran,<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Itre mba he ka juju bubu gru riwa a he hwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">Irɨme mba sho ri che,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">nga itre mba he ka intson meme manzɨrama,<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Itre mba sho ri meme tre ri fu<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Wa chichi kpa sron nji time, wari wuu nji,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />ko kutan riwa wa hi, wa wuu nji wari no nji yaa,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Wa ran to nkon son sisron ran<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />wa ran he ri sisri Izhi ri sron mba ran.&lt;&lt; <verse eid="ROM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Zizan ki to ri kongye riwa doka Musa ri tre ari tre ri wawa wa he ri ndodza wan nye, ritu no wa wa nkon ritu meme ti mba no wa ran fe ran nga no wa tsro ri mgbumgblume wawu wa he ri ndodza bla tre Izhi <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Injo ran hon he ri meme ti kusi Izhi ran, ri nkon ti kya riwa doka Musa tre no wa ran ikya riwa doka ri tsro ta he ritu ki ti meme ti.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inji wa ti ndidi hu ri Yeso Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ama zizan wa tsro ta nkon bibi riwa ki ti tsra ri Izhi ititsra nyi ran he ri doka musa ran ko riwa doka Musa nga mbe wawa wa la tre ri kusi wa tre ritu wan. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Ndinditi nyi riwa nji wa fe rimi yosron ri Yeso Kristo, wa kpanyime ri Kristo ritu iti nkan ran he rimi wan ran: <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />ko ngaa ti meme ti, nga ki ri ran he ri tsitsri ri kusi Izhi ran. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ama ritu ndindi ti Izhi, ko ngaa son a ran he ri meme ti ran, ritu Yeso Kristo riwa a kpa wa chuwo. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Izhi ka Yeso de ritu ri yii wan no he nkon riwa wa ka meme ti nji rega ritu kpanyime mba ri wu, <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Izhi a ti rinyi ritu ri sen a he ri vu sron nga ran ran yo si ri meme ti nji ran, ama zizan ari yosi ri wa ritu ran tsro ri wawu kyuwan he ti tsra nga ran no ko ngaa riwa a kpanyime ri no ti tsra ri Yeso.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Ko ingye ki kpongambu ri wu? ba kya! Rinyi he ritu ngye nye? onhon ama ritu ki yosron. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Kinyime ri ri yosron nye nji ri ti tsra ri Izhi a ran ri hu kya riwa doka tre ran. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ko ka Izhi he Izhi wa nji Yahuda nye kare? Aran he Izhi wawa wa ran he nji Yahuda ngawen ran? <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Izhi he riri nga ari no nji Yahuda no wa ti tsra ri wawu ritu yosron mba, wawa nga wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran ngawen ritu yosron mba. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Ko mba ri Yosron ki ka doka Musa rega nye mba? Aran ngaamba ran ki milan-u ngɨzhi.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Bibi Ti riwa Ibrahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Ko Ingye nye ki tre ritu Ibrahi A ti wa timbu? ingye nye a to ritu ti tsra ri Izhi? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ka Ibrahi a ti tsra ri Izhi ritu kyawa riwa a ti ari he ri kya riwa ari kpo ngawan ri wu ama a ran ri kusi Izhi ran. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Imbe Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ibrahi a kpa nyime ri Izhi nga ritu Yosron wan Izhi a yo-o rimi wawa wa ti tsra kusi wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Inji riwa a ti ndu wa no kya ritu ndu wan, ama a ran he de ri kuklu ran; a he kya riwa a ti ndu ritu wan. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ama nji riwa a yosi rimi Yosron a ran rimi ndu wan ran nga nji riwa a kpanyime ri Izhi riwa ari no wawa wana ri ti bibi wa Izhi ran no wa ti tsra kusi Izhi a he Yosron-a nye Izhi ri ya ran no wa he wa ti tsra ri ngawan. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Rinyi nye he kya riwa Doda a ran tre ritu wan riwa a tre ritu wan riwa a tre ri kinklan sron nji riwa Izhi ban wu a he nji ri ndindi ti a ran ritu a ti ndu ritu wan ran.<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Kinklan sron he wa nji riwa wa ka meme ti wan rega nga wari ka meme ti wan don ri wu!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Kinklan sron he wa nji riwa Bachi ran bla meme ti wan dzi ran!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Kinklan sron nyi riwa Doda a tre ritu wan-a he wa wawa wa fon wa nju kakre nye? Onhon! A he wa wawa wa ran fon wa nju ran ngawen ikya riwa ki tre a he rimi mbe Izhi nye ri,&lt;&lt;Ibrahi a kpanyime ri Izhi nga ritu Yosron wan Izhi a ban wu no he nji ri ndindi ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Shitan nye Izhi a ban wu he nji ri ndindi ti? A he ka wa ran fon Ibralu nju rina ka kugon riwa wa fon wu nju? A he ka wa ran fon wu nju rina. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Wa fon wu nji kugon nga ifon nju wan-a a tsro ri ritu Yosron wan nye Izhi a ban wu ri a he nji ri ndiditi ri ko wa fon wu nju nga ritu ngamba Ibrahi he A ti ri wu riwa wawa wa kpa nyime ri Izhi nga Izhi ri kɨma wa he wa ndindi ti ko ri riwa wa ran fon wa nju ran. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Ibrahi he ti wawa wa fon wa nju ngawen ama nga wawa wa hu bibi ti riwa Yosron riwa A ti mba ibrai a he ri wu ri ko wa fon wu nju rina.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa fe Katredzi riwa Izhi hu ri Yosron.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Riwa Izhi a katre dzi ri ibrai nga wa nghɨran wan ri mgbumgblume ri he wa ma, a ti ngamba a ran ritu ibrai a hu doka ran ama ritu a kpanyime nga Izhi ka kpa-a ti nji ri ndindi ti ri ngawen, <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Ka ikya riwa Izhi katredzi ritu wan a he riwa wa no wawa wa hu doka Musa nye imba yosron ran he kyari ran nga ika tredzi riwa Izhi ri he kukulu. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Ama doka ri ngɨzhi fu Izhi ye. Ama bubu riwa doka ran he ran ika hu doka ran he ran. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Riti ngamba ikatredzi ri he rimi Yosron nye ritu no katredzi riwa Izhi no he wa wa nghɨran Ibrahi a ran wawa wa hu doka kakre ran ama ri wawa wa kpanyime bibi riwa Ibrahi a ti ngawen. Ritu Ibrahi he A ti mbu wa hu Izhi wawu. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />bibi riwa imbe Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Me ban wu no he ti wa rɨme wawu ri mgblume.&gt;&gt; Ikatredzi bi ri kusi Izhi: nji riwa Ibrahi kpanyime ri wu shime ri bubu gru nga riwa a kɨma kya riwa a ran ri viri ran no viri. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ibrahi a kpanyime nga ran Yosron ko ri riwa ikyari a ran he riwa ari yosron ran nga ka he,&lt;&lt;A ti gbungblume wawu.&gt;&gt;Bibi riwa imbe Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Wa nghɨran wen wa kigbu ka intsen hwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />A don tsawen riwa ise wan ran he gbigba ri ama yosron wan a kawan senkpa ri riwa a taka kpa wan riwa a ran kuu-e ritu nchon, nga ritu Saratu a ran ngɨzhi vren ran. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Yosron wan ka ran ka-u chuwo ran nga a ran yo sron hari rimi katredzi riwa Izhi ran yosron wan a no gbengbren nga ka gbre Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />A nyime iri Izhi ri ti kya riwa a ka dzi iri wawu ri ti. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ritu yosron Ibrahi nye,&lt;&lt;Izhi a ban wu a he nji ri ndindi ti.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Itre&lt;&lt;A he nji ri ndindi.&gt;&gt;Wa ran ngan ritu wan kakre ran. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Wa ngan wa ritu kita wawa wa kpa ta he wa ndindi ti ngawen wawa ki kpanyime riwu riwa a ta Yeso Bachi mbu shime ri bubu gru. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Ritu meme ti mbu wa ka Yeso de no kuu nga wa tashime ritu ran no ta ki ti tsra ri kusi Izhi.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Ison tsra ri Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Zizan riwa ki fe son riwa a tsra ri Izhi ritu yosron, ki he ri si sron ri Izhi ritu Bachi Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Ritu wan nye ki fe son rimi ndindi ti nyi riwa ki son ki ri kpo ngambu ritu yosron mbu nga ki he rimi wawa wa fe mkpen riwa Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ama ki kpongambu ritu Yaa mbu ngawen ritu ki to ri iyaa ri ngɨzhi vu sron ye, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />ivu sron ri ngɨzhi son ndindi ye, nga ison ndindi ri ngɨzhi yosron ri Izhi ye. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Yosron nye ran ri gyuru ta ran, ran he kuklu ran ritu Izhi yo nyime wan ri sron mbu hu ri Yuu Tsitsri riwa a he ide riwa Izhi no ta. <verse eid="ROM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Riwa ki ran he ri nkon ri dzon ngambu ran, Kristo ka ye ri vi riwa a tsra ran ye kuu ritu mbu wa meme ti. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Ari he kya ri Yaa no njo no kuu ri nji riwa ari son tsra. Ama injo ri to vu sron ran kuu ri nji riwa a he ri ndindi ti. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ama Izhi tsro ta bibi nyime riwa a nyime ta, a he riwa ki he rimi ti meme ti nye Kristo a kuu ritu mbu! <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Izhi kɨma ta ti wa ndindi ti ritu kuu vren wan, ko ari he rise ri chachu fu Izhi ki to ri Kristo ri kpa ta chuwo ri wu. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ki ran he kpan fu Izhi, ama a kɨma ta he wa kpan wan ritu kuu vren wan, zizan riwa ki he kpan wan ki to ri ki fe kpachuwo ritu he vren wan Kristo! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Ama a ran he rimba kakre ran, ki ngiri ritu kya riwa Izhi ti hu ri Bachi Yeso Kristo riwa a kɨma ta zizan ki he wa kpan Izhi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu nga Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Memeti ye ri mgbumgblu me hu ri nji riri nye nga meme ti wan ngizhi kuu ye ri wu. Ritu wan nye ikuu shan gra ri nji ko kutan ritu ko ngaa ti meme ti. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Memeti a ye ri mgbumglume ri ko wa de doka, ama bubu riwa doka ran he ran meme ti ran he ri bubu wan ran. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ama ri vi Adamu hi ri vi Musa ikuu a han gbengbren nji wawu, a han gbengbren wawa wa ran ti meme ti bibi riwa Adamu a ti ran riwa a ran hu tre Izhi riwa Adamu he bibi de riwa Izhi riwa ari ye-a. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ama haha mba wa ran he bibi riri ran, ritu ide Izhi ran he ka meme ti Adamu ran a he kpunji nye nji kigbu wa kuu ritu meme ti nji riri mba. Ama ndindi ti Izhi han nga a he de wari ri hu ri no nji kigbu hu ri ndindi ti nji riri-a Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Ngha itinkan he rimi de riwa Izhi nga meme ti riwa nji riri-a kugon meme ti nji riri-a iyaa wa,&lt;&lt;Memeti ka ye ama kugon meme ti kigbu, ide riwa Izhi a no nji wana ti&lt;&lt;Memeti ngaran&gt;&gt; Ka ye. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />A he kpunji nye ri, ritu meme ti nji riri-a ama rigra kya riwa nji riri-a ti ri he rise Yeso Kristo! Wawa wa kpa nchon ri wu wa he kpanchi ri vri hu ri Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Ritu ngamba bibi riwa meme ti nji riri-a wuu nji wawu ngamba nye mee ndindi ti nji riri-a kpa nji wawu chuwo ran no wa vri. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ngha bibi riwa nji wawu wa ti meme ti ritu ka wo tre nji riria ngamba nye mee wa kɨma wa he wa ndindi ti ri Izhi ritu wo tre nji riri-a. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Wa ngɨzhi doka ye ritu no meme ti no kigbu, ama bubu riwa meme ti ri kigbu ndindi ti Izhi ri kigbu han. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Ritu bibi riwa meme ti ri han gbengbren ritu kuu, ngamba nye me ndindi nditi ari ngaizhi ta hi ri son riwa a ran kre ran hu ri Yeso Kristo Bachi mbu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Ikuu ri Memeti Ison ri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Ko ingye nye ki tre, ki sondu ran ti meme ti bibi riwa no ndindi ti Izhi no bran? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Onhoon! ki kuu rimi memeti, Ko ari he se no ta ki son rimi wan? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Ka bi ran to ran, riwa wa ran son ta tu ri ima rimi kabrutu ri Kristo Yeso wa ran son ta tu ima rimi kabrutu ri kuu ri wu ran? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Ritu son ta tu ri ima-a wa no ta yibi ri wu nga ki he rimi kuu wan ngawen ritu bibi riwa wa ta Kristo shime rimi kuu ritu gbengbren mkpen A ti nga ki ri son rimi son ri sa. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Riwa ki he riri ri wu rimi kuu bibi riwa a kuu ngamba nye mee ki he riri ri wu rimi tashime riwa a he. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Nga ki to iri wa kpa mbu ri meme ti sen wa wu-u ri Kristo ritu kon kron ritu no wa wuu gbengbren meme ti ri kpa ritu kiri ran he gran meme ti ngaran. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Ritu riwa ki kuu ri Kristo ki jibu ri gbengbren meme ti. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Riwa ki kuu ri Kristo ki kpanyime ri ki son ri wu. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Ritu ki to ri Kristo tashime ri kuu Ikuu-a ran han mgbembren wan ngaran. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ri ngamba ritu a kuu, ikuu ran he ri gbengbren ritu wan ngaran, nga zizan ari sonson wan ri Izhi kakre. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ri ngamba nye mee bi taka ngawen ka ikɨmo ri wo gbengbren meme ti, ama ison rimi kabrutu ri Izhi hu ri Kristo Yeso.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Memeti no ran han gbengbren kpa mbi ngaran ritu bi ri ran ti meme ti ngaran. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Ran ka gbɨre kpa mbi ri no meme ti no ti ndu ri meme ti wan ri wu ran, Ara bi ka tu mbi no Izhi bibi riwa wawa wa vu wa rimi kuu ye vi son si, nga bi ri ka kpa mbi wawu no riwa ari ti ndu ritu ndindi ti. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />No meme ti no ran he ti ko mbi ran ritu bi ran he ritu doka ran, ama ri ndodza ndindi ti Izhi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki he gran ri Ndindi ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />A bi ngamaba riwa ndindi ti Izhi kpata chuwo ri wo doka ko mbaron ki sondu ran ti meme ti nye mba? Onhon! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Bi ran to ran ka bi katu mbi yo riwa bi he wa hu tre njo ka bi he gran nji riwa bi hu tre wan-a nye mbana? Bi to he gran meme ti riwa ari ngɨzhi nji hi ri kuu ko ka bi hu tre Izhi riwa ari ngɨzhi yi hi ri son ri ndindi ti ri Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ama ingiri he wa Izhi! Riwa bi ran he gran risen ama zizan bi hu tsro riwa ki tsro yi ri sron mbi riri. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Wa kpa yi chuwo riwo meme ti nga bi kɨma he gran bi he gran ndindi ti. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Me tre ri yi bibi riwa nji nye, ritu kughiren mbi riwa nji bibi riwa ri sen bi sondu ran ka kpa mbi nga meme ti hu kyawa wa zuu nga meme ti riwa a ran kigbu hi ka kre ngabba nye zizan bi ka ka kpa mbi yo rimi hu ndindi ti ritu bi ri he wa wa wa ki ri tsitsri. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Riwa bi ran he gran meme ti bi ran fe nkon ti ndindi ti ngaran. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Ingye nye bi fe risen rimi kya riwa ishan ri ti yi ritu wan zizan? ikya riwa bi fe ritu wan he kuu! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ama zizan riwa wa kpa yi chu wo rimi meme ti nga bi he gran Izhi ikya riwa bi fe rimi wan nye ngɨzhi yi hi rimi son ri tsitsri nga ran ngɨzhi vri riwa a ran kre ran ye ri yi. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ritu ikya riwa bi fe rimi meme ti a he kuu, ama ikya riwa Izhi ri no yi he vri riwa a ran kre ran rimi kabru tu ri kristo Yeso Bachi.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Bibi ti rimi gran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Biyi wa vayi won bi to kya riwa me wa meri tre nyi ritu wawu mbi to doka Musa nyi, doka ri han mgbemgren nji ka nji he si nye kakre. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />To ri waa riwa a gran ari hu doka ron wan riwa a he si; ama ka iron wan kuu doka ri gran riwa a he wa imba ron wan-a ran he ngaran. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ri ngamba ka a gran nji ri nkan riwa iron wan he ri si ri, wa yo-u ri iwaa ri kru ri ron waa njo ama bru gran njo ri rimba ran ran he ku ron waa njo ran nye mba. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Wa miri vayi won, ngamba nye a he ri yi biyi ngawen bi kuu ritu bi kabru tu ri kpa Kristo nga zizan bi he wa ma riwa a tashime ri kuu ritu bi ri he kya ndindi rimi ndu Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Ritu ka ki son bibi riwa kpa mbu doka ri ran shogon meme riwa ki ti kre ri kuu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Zizan wa kpa ta chuwo riwo doka ritu ki kuu ritu kya riwa a kɨma ta ti gran ki ran ri ti kyawa wa sen riwa wa ngan-a ngaran ama bibi ti ri sisa riwa wu.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Doka nga Memeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Ko ki tre mbaron ri doka he meme ti nye mba? Aran ngamba ran! Ama doka nye a no wen me to meme ti. Wari tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ran ti mbye kyari riwa a he wa njo ri nkan ran.&gt;&gt;Meri ran to imbye mba ran. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ama ritu doka nye meme ti fe nkon riwa ran tru wen nchi rimi mbye ri kpa won. Wari tre doka Musa ran he ran meme ti ran ran he ri gbengbren ran. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Riwa me ran to doka Musa ri ran, me ran he ri si, ama riwa doka Musa a ye meme ti ka tashime ri si, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />nga me kuu. Nga doka riwa a he ritu ran ngɨzhi vri ye, riwa mo a ngɨzhi kuu ye ri mo. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Memeti a fe nkon wan nga ritu doka nye a gyuru wen ran wuu wen. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ritu ngamba itsro kyuwan he tsitsri, nga doka he tstsri, ti ndindi ti nga ran bi. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ama ko mba ikya riwa ndindi ti nye ngɨzhi kuu won ye? A ran ngamba ran a he meme ti nye ngɨzhi kuu wen ye a ti ndu ri kya riwa a he ndindi meme ti ngɨzhi kuu ye rimo ritu ran no wa to bibi riwa meme ti he, nga ritu doka nye meme ti zhi ri ngawen ka meme ti-a<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iku Memeti rimi sronmbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Ki to rinyi ri doka Izhi he kya ri Yuu nye, ama ame me ti kya riwa kpa me he gran riwo meme ti. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Me ran to tu kya riwa me ti ran, me ran ri ti kya riwa me wa ti ran, ame me ti kya riwa me kawon ri wu. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Riwa a he ri me ti kya riwa me ran wa ti-u ran ri nyi tsro ri me nyime ri doka tsra. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Ko mba a ran ame ri tuwon nye me ti-u ran, a he meme ti riwa a he rimi sron won nye. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Me to ri dindi ti ran he rimi sron won ran me miyen kpa won riwa nji ko ri riwa mbye ri ti ndiditi he ri mo rimi sron ama me ran ri to ti-u ran. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Me ran ri ti ndindi ti riwa me wa ti-a ran, ara me ti meme ti riwa me kawon ri wu-a nye. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Ka me ti kya riwa me ra wa ti-u ran, ko mba a ran he ame nye me ti-u ran; Me to ri a he meme ti riwa a he rimi sron won nye ti-u. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Imba me to ri doka nye ri ti ndu ka me wa me ri ti kya ndindi ikya meme nye ka he mo ri sron. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Rimi sron won me nyime doka Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ama me to doka ri nkan nye ri ti ndu ri sron won, doka riwa ari kawan ri doka Musa riwa isron won nyime-u, a lo wen yo rimi doka meme ti riwa wawu nye ri ti ndu sron won. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Iyaa won! Ingaa nye ri kpa wen chuwo rimi kpa nye riwa a ngɨzhi wen i hi ri kuu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Me ngiri ri Izhi riwa a ti rinye hu ri Bachi Yeso Kristo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Ri ngamba; ame rimi sron won me wa meri hu doka Izhi, ama ikpa won riwa nji ri hu doka meme ti.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Ison rimi Yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Ritu ngamba wa ran wuu nji zizan ran ritu wawa wa he rimi kabrutu ri Kristo Yeso. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Ritu doka riwa Yuu riwa a ngɨzhi a kpa wen chu wo ri wo doka meme ti nga kuu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Ikya riwa doka ran to ti ran ritu ikpa riwa nji a ran senkpa ran, Izhi a ti-u a kpa meme ti ri kpa riwa nji time riwa a tru kpa bibi wambu ri meme ti no ban meme ti zho. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Izhi a ti rinyi ritu ndu ri ndindi riwa doka ri wa no ye ri ta wawa ki sonson bibi riwa Iyu nga a ran bibi wa nji ran.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Wawa wa hu kya riwa ikpa mba la wa no wa ti wa ka sron mba no kpa mba riwa, nji wawa wa ti kya riwa Iyu la wa no wa ti wawa wa ka sron mba no wu Tsitsri. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Ika ngangawen no kpa riwa nji ari ngɨzhi nji hi nkon kuu, ama ika ngawen no Yuu ri ngɨzhi vri nga sisron ye. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Nga ngamba nye nji wa kɨma he kpan fu Izhi ka wa ka sron mba no kpa ri wa nji wa ran hu tre Izhi ran nga kpunji tre wa ran hu tre wan ran. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Wawa wa hu kpa mba riwa nji wa ran si Izhi sron ran. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ama a wu ran sonson bibi riwa ikpa wen la-u no ti ran ara bi ti kya riwa iyu la yi no yi ti ka iyu Izhi he ri wu nji riwa a ran he ri Yuu riwa Kristo ran a ran he wa ma ran. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ama I Kristo he ri wu Iyu-a ri he vri wen ritu wu ti ndindi ti ri kusi Izhi ko ri riwa wa kpa wen wa kuu ritu meme ti. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />I Iyu Izhi riwa a ta Yeso shime ri bubu gru a son rimi kpa wen nga wawu riwa a ta Kristo shime ri bubu gru ri no kpa wen riwa nji ngawen ritu Iyu wan he rimi sron wen.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Ritu ngamba biyi wa miri vayi won, ki he ri yaa ri tu wen ama ki ran sonson bibi riwa ikpa mbu ri wa ki son ran. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Ritu ka wu sonson bibi riwa kpa wen riwa nji ri wa wu hi bubu kuu, ama i a he gbengbren Yuu nye bi ka meme ti mbi rega bi son ri si. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Nji wawa wa hu tre Yuu Izhi wa he miri Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Ritu Iyu riwa wa no yi he gran ran nga ran no yi he sisri ran, ama Iyu-a ri kɨma yi bi he miri Izhi nga ri Yuu-a gbengbren ri nzu raan ri,&lt;&lt;A ti! A ti won!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Iyu Izhi ri kabru ri Yuu mba ran la ri ki he miri Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Riwa ki he miri wan, ki fe tilibu riwa a ka dzi ri wa nji wan, nga ki fe kya rimi kya riwa Izhi kadzi ri Kristo; I ki kabru wo rimi so ya ri Kristo, ki kabru wo rimi mkpen wan ngawen.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imkpen ri kusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Bibi yaa riwa ki so zizan a ran ka ngawan kabru ri mkpen riwa wa nghɨran ri ta kusi ran. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Mgbumgblume wa son ri gben no Izhi no nghɨran wa ngha wa he miri wan. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Mgbumgblume a ran to ti kya riwa a ran wa ran ti ran, a ran he ti wan nye ran, ama Izhi a no no he ngamba. Kau ri ngamba yosron ka he. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Iri mgbumgblume kyuwan ri kpa kpangawan chuwo ri wo ndu gran ri kuu nga wa kabru wo rimi fe sontu ri mkpen riwa miri Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ritu ki to ri sisenmu ye ri vi ri zizan mgbumgblume ri kpachu ritu lo ka iwaa ri ngɨzhi. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Ama a ran he mgbumgblume nye kakre ri kpachu ran; kita wawa ki he ri Yuu bibi de ri mimilan riwa Izhi a de ngawen ki kpachu rimi ngambu riwa ki ki ri gben Izhi no kɨma ta ti miri wan ran kpa ta chuwo rimi kpa. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />A he ritu yosron nye ki fe kpachuwa; ama i ki to kya riwa ki yosron ritu wan, imba ran he yosron ran. Ingaa rimi mbu ri yosron rimi kya riwa ki to? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ama i ki yosron ri kya riwa ki ran to ran, ki ki ran gben ri vu sron. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ngamba nye mee Iyu Izhi ngawen ri ye dzon ta, riwa ikpa mbu ran senkpa ran. Ki ran to bibi riwa ki bre Izhi ran; Iyu kyuwan ri bre Izhi ritu mbu rimi kpachu riwa iwɨlo tre ran ri to tre ran. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Nga Izhi riwa a to mi sron mbu, ran to kya riwa Iyu ri rimiren ritu wan; ritu Iyu ri bre Izhi ritu wa nji wan nga bibi riwa a wa ran ti. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Ki to rimi ko ngye Izhi ri ti ndu ndindi ri wawa wa nyime-u, wawa a yo wa bibi riwa isron wan su. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Wawa Izhi gbuchi chu wa ran kɨma wa ki ri gran no wa he ka miri wan, ritu Ivren wan ri he ri mimilan rimi ikigbu wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Nga wawa Izhi kɨma wa ki ri gran, a yo wa; a kɨma wa ti wawa wa ran ti meme ti kusi wan ran, nga ran no wa mkpen.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyime Izhi Rimi Kristo Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Ri ya kyawa wanyi wawu, ingye nye ki tre? Ka Izhi he kusan mbu, ingaa nye ri yo ta kusi? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Izhi ran ka vren wan nnyo ta ran, ama a ka-u no ta wawu! A ka vɨren wan no ta ko a ran ka kongye no ta ran? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ingaa ri ngaa nji wawa Izhi ju wa ri meme ti? Izhi kyuwan kɨma wa ti wawa wa ran ti meme ti ran! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Ko inga ri wuu wa? Aran Kristo Yeso ran, riwa a kuu, ko ka riwa a tashime ri kuu nga ran son ri kuwo ri Izhi, ran ri bre wu ritu mbu! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Inga nye ri ga ta ri nyime Kristo? Ka iwanyu, ka iyaa, ka iyon, ka ika he ri kya, ka ikya meme ka ikuu? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Bibi riwa imbe Izhi tre ri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">&lt;&lt;Ritu wen nye bla vi ki he ri bubu meme ri kuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">wa no ta yaa ka ki he ntɨma wawa wa ngɨzhi wa ri hi bubu han.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Onhon, rimi kyawa wa nyi wawu ki he ri hangbengbɨren hu ri wawu riwa a nyime ta! <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ritu me to ri ikyari ran ga ta ri nyime Izhi ran: ka ikuu ka ivri, ko ka miri ko Izhi ka wa kpanchi ri shu ka gbengbren riwa a he, ka zizan ka kusi, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />ka mgbumgblume ri shu ka ri meme, ikya ri ran he rimi mgbumgblume riwa ari to ga ta rimi Izhi riwa a he wambu hu ri Bachi mbu Kristo Yeso.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Izhi Nga wa Nji wan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Me tre kpunji; me he wa Kristo, me ran ti che ran. Rimi rimiren ri sron won riwa Iyu Tsitsri nye ri la wen kyawa, a la wen ri me ran ti che ran <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />ka me tre bibi nchon shnji sron riwa me he ri wu, bibi lo riwa a he mo ri sron <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />ritu wa nji won, wa miri vayi won! Ritu mba ran he ri mo mba ka Izhi ran la nyun ri mo nga ran ga wen ri Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Wa nji Israila wa he wa nji Izhi; a kɨma wa ti miri wan nga ran nghɨran mkpen wan ri wa; a katredzi ri wa ran no wa doka; wari gbre ri kpunji; wa kpa kyawa wawa Izhi ka dzi ri wawu ri no wa; <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />wa he wa gɨzhi wa zhu ri wa ti wa ti wa nji Hebruniyawa nga Kristo ka nji, a he gran mba. No Izhi, riwa a he ri kpanchison riwa kongaa, no wa gbre! No he ngamba. <verse eid="ROM 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Me ran ri tre ikatredzi riwa Izhi a ran to ti-u ran; ritu a ran wawuu, wa nji Israila nye wa he wa nji Izhi ran. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Nga a ran gran Ibrahi wawu nye wa he miri Izhi ran. Izhi a la Ibrahi ri, &lt;&lt;Ritu Ishaku nye wu fe gran riwa me tre ri me no-u.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ko kyena imiri wawa wa ngɨzhi wa rimi kpa wa ran he miri Izhi ran; ara, imiri wawan wa ngɨzhi bibi riwa Izhi tre dzi wawa nye wa he gran ri kpunji. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ikya riwa Izhi a la Ibrahi a he iri, &lt;&lt;Ri vi riwa a tsra me bru ye, nga Saratu ri he ri vren.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Nga a ran rinyi kakre ran. Imiri Rabeka hari-a wa he miri A ti mbu Ishaku. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-12" />Ama ko no wa ngɨzhi miri wamba hari, Izhi a la Rabeka ri, &lt;&lt;Ivren rinkon ri ti ndu ri vren ri tsitsa.&gt;&gt;Ikya nyi a he ri ko no wa ti kya meme ko kya riwa a bi. Izhi a tre ngamba ritu no he ri, nji riwa wa chu wu wa chu ritu bibi riwa Izhi wa no he, a ran ritu ndu ran, tsede ritu yo Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 9:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Bibi riwa imbe Izhi tre ri, &lt;&lt;Me nyime Yakubu nga meri kawon ri Isuwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Ko ingye nye ki tre? ko ki tre ri Izhi ran ti tsra ran nye mba? Aran ngamba ran. <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Izhi a la Musa ri, &lt;&lt;Me losron ri ko ngaa riwa me wa; Me ya losron ri ko ngaa riwa me wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Ri ngamba, kongye ran he ritu kya riwa kita nji ki wa ki ti ran, ama a he ritu losron Izhi nye. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Imbe Izhi a tre ri Friyona ichu Masar ri, &lt;&lt;Me no-u chu ritu me ri tsro gbengbren won ritu wen, nga wari la nde won ri mgbumgblume wawu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Ri ngamba nye Izhi ri losron ri nji riwa isron wan nyime-u, nga ran sentu nji riwa isron wan nyime-u bibi riwa a ran to wo ran.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifu Izhi Nga Losron wan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ama iri rimi mbi ri tre mo ri, &lt;&lt;I a he ngamba nye, ko Izhi ri ti rise ran fe njo ri meme ti? Ingaa ri kawan ri ti Izhi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ama a wu wu he ngaa nye ikpan won, riwa wu janyu ri Izhi? Irii ntime ran ri miyen nji riwa ari mee ri, &lt;&lt;Ritu ngye ko wu ti wen nganyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Kugon kongye, nji riwa ari mme ri-a he ri gbengbren riwa ari ti ndu ri ntime bibi riwa isron wan su, nga ran mme ri hari rimi ntme-a, iri ri he riwa chanchon vi roo nga ri wan riwa wa tindu riwu bla vi. <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Nga ikya riwa Izhi ti a tsra. A wa ran tsro fu wan ri kongaa nga ran wa no ko ngaa no to gbengbren wan. Ama a he ri vu sron ri wawa wawa nye wa kpa sron wan time, wawa wa sondu ran dzi tsu. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Ngha a wa ran nghɨran nchi mkpen wan, riwa wa ka bwa ta wawa ari losron ri ta,wari mbu wawa ki milan ki riwa ki kpa mkpen wan. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Ritu ki he wa nji wawa a yo ta, a ran rimi wa nji Yahuda kakre ran ama kau ri wari rimi wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran ngawen. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ngye kya riwa Izhi a tre rimi mbe Hosiya een:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;&lt;Inji wawa wa ran he wa nji won ran me ran yo wa ri wa he wa mo ran.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Igbu riwa me ran nyime-u ran me yo wa ri wawa me nyime wa.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Nga ri bubu riwa wa la wa ri, &lt;Bi ran he wa nji won ran,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">ri bubu wan nye wa yo wa ri imiri Izhi riwa ari vri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Nga Ishaya a yii ritu wa nji Israila:&lt;&lt;Ko wari tre ri wa nji Israila wa kigbu ka meme nzan ri nyu nne, ari he tsawen gyen rimi mba nye wa fe kpachuwo; <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />ritu Bachi ri chichi kre tre wan ri mgbumgblume.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />A he bibi riwa Ishaya a tre ri sen ri,&lt;&lt;Wari tre ri Bachi Kristo ran ka ta gɨzhi wari don ran, ki ri he ka wa nji Sadom, imba Gomora.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israila Nga Tre Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Nghamba nye ki tre ritu wawa wa ran he wan Yahuda ran, wawa wa ran wa wari milan son mba ti ri Izhi ran, wa milan son mba ti ri Izhi ritu yosron; <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />ama wa nji Izhi wawa wawa wa ran wa doka riwa ari no wa ti tsra ri Izhi, wa ran fe wu ran. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Nga ritu ngye? Ritu wa ran ka tu mba yo rimi yosron ran ama rimi kya riwa wa ti. Nga ngamba nye wa kɨbu dza ritu&lt;&lt;Ku wo tav&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Rimba nye imbe Izhi tre ritu wan ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;&lt;Ya, me ka tita ri yo ri Siyona riwa ari no nji no wa kɨbu dza, tita riwa ari no wa joku.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Ama nji riwa a kpanyime ri tita-a ishan ran ti-u ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Imiri vayi ikya riwa isron won ri wa nga ibrewon ri Izhi he ri no wa nji Israila no wa fe ikpa chuwo. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Me to iri wa ka tu mba no Izhi branbran ama rinyi ran he ri to tuwan kpunji ran. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Riwa wana to nkon riwa Izhi ri ti no nji kɨma riwa mba dzi riwa wawa wana ti meme ti kusi Izhi ran imba ritu rinyi nye a ran no wa don tu mba ri nkon riwa Izhi ri no nji no wa he wawa wa ran ti meme ti ran. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />A he Kristo nye riwa ari ngiji kre doka ye ritu nji riwa ari yo sron a ran nji ri meme ti kusi Izhi ran.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikpachuwo he wa ko ngaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Musa a ngan ritu fe son riwa wa ran ti meme ti ran ritu hu doka a tre ri,&lt;&lt;Inji riwa a hu doka nyi ari son ritu wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ama ingye ikya riwa ndindi ti rimi yosron tre-a-en,&lt;&lt;Ran tre rimi sron wan ri,&lt;Ingan nye ri hon hi shu?&gt;&gt;(Riwa ari hi ngizhi Kristo ye ri meme). <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />&lt;&lt;Ko ingan ri gɨzhi ri shu ye meme?&gt;&gt; (Ran ye ta Kristo shime rimi kuu nganga). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />IKya riwa imbe nyi ri tre-a he ri,&lt;&lt;Itre Izhi he hyire ri wu a he ri nyu wen nga rimi sron wen.&gt;&gt;Itre nyi wawu nye he tre ri yo sron riwa ki tre-a. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />I wu la ri nyu wen ri Yeso nye he Bachi wu ri yo sron rimi sron wen ri Izhi taa shime rimi kuu wa kpa-u chuwo. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ri sron nye wa yo sron wa ri fe son riwa wana he ri meme ti kusi Izhi ran nga ri nyu nye wa la meme ti wari fe kpachuwo. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Bibi riwa ingan tre Izhi a tre ri.&lt;&lt;Inji riwa a yo sron ri wu ishan ran ti-u ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ri wa nji Yahuda ri riwa a ran he wa nji Yahuda ran wawumba wa riri wawu Bachi riri-a nye he Bachi ko ngan wawu nye ri no ko ngaa kyawa riwa iwa ngiji yi mba hi ri wu. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Bibi riwa ingan tre Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Inji riwa a yo nde Bachi ari fe ikpachuwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Ama nji wa tise ko wari yo riwa wana yo sron riwu ran, nga wa tise ko wari yosron wa ti ri se wari wo inde injo ran he riwa ari lawa tre ran? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Wa tre tre Izhi wa tise wari la tre Izhi i wa ran ti wa ndu ran? Bibi riwa a he rimi ngaa ri,&lt;&lt;Iye wa wa wa ngiji tre Izhi ye a he kya riwa a bi mgbazhi ran!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ama a ran he nji wawu nye wa kpanyime ri tre ri ndindi-a ran, Bibi riwa Ishaya a tre ri,&lt;&lt; A wu Bachi ingaa yosron ri la tre mbu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Ritu ngamba, wa yo sron ritu wo tre-a nye nga wa wo tre ritu Bachi nye. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ama me miye: a he kpunji nye riwa wa ran wo tre-a ran? Ai wa wo bibi riwa itre Izhi tre ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">&lt;&lt; Iraan mba wa gra ri mgbumgblume;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">iwɨlo tre mba a zhu ri kre meme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Me bru miyen, wa nji Israila wana to tre Izhi-a ran ? Mimilan Musa a kpa nyime ri Izhi tre ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;Me no yi ti huu ri wanji wawa wana bran ran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">nga me no yi ti fu dzu riwo wawa wana wɨri ran nye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Imba nganga Ishaya ri vu sron ran la ri Izhi tre ri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;Inji wawa wana wa wen ran wawa nye wa fe wen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">me ka ngawon la wawa wa ran miyen bibi ri wa a fe wen ran.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ama ritu wa nji israila Izhi a tre ri,&lt;&lt;Zhakuu me dren wo ri wawa wana ri wo tre ran nga wawa wa ka wo tre.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Ilosron Izhi ri Wa nji Israila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />To me miyen wa ri: Izhi kawan ri wa nji wan Israila nye? Onhoon, me zhu ri gɨzhi ibrai nji ri gbu Benjami. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Izhi ran kawan ri wa nji wan wawa a zhu wa ri mimilan ran. Biyi bi to kya riwa ingaa tre Izhi tre ritu ilya wa to bibi Israila ri. <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Bachi wa wuu wa la tre wen wari dzi wa bubu ka kpi Izhi ki a ra ame ri kankshi won me don nga wa wa wari wuu wen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Inyime itan nye Izhi a no? A nyime ri,&lt;&lt;Me ka nji ki ri ngawon riwa wa ngo tamgban wawa wa ran ri kɨbu mgbazu ri ji riwa wa yo wa ri Baal ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Nganyi nye rinyi he zizan ngbron nji wari wa he wawa Izhi zhu wa rimi ndindi ti wan. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Izhu nyi riwa Izhi ti-a a ti ritu ti ndindi ti wan nye a ran ritu ndu riwa wa nji-a wa ti ran. Ran ran he ka wa ran ndindi ti-a, ran ran he ndindi ti ri kpunji ran. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Ko ari he ri se? Riwa wa nji Israila wa ran fe kya riwa wa wa ran, wari tsawen rimi wawa wa zhu wa wa fe ama imgbron mba wa he wa sentu. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Bibi riwa a he rimi ngan mbe Izhi ri:&lt;&lt;Izhi a Kima wa he wawa wana ri to tu kyari ran a no wa si riwa wana ri to ran, nga ton riwa wana ri wo riwu ran. Rinyi he ye kusi luwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Doda ngawen a tre ri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">&lt;&lt;No ro mba no he ro ri yo damgban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">no he kya riwa ari ngɨzhi kɨbu dza ye nga kya riwa ari ngɨzhi joku ye ikya riwa ari noo wa chu wa baan ye.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />No wa si mba no wa ti bu ritu no wa ran to tsu ran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">nga no gon mba no nime ritu yaa riwa a ran kre ran&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Me kawon ri miyen, riwa wa nji Israila wa kɨbu dza, wa joku wana wulunde ran nye? Iminyi! Ko tsawen ritu meme ti mba ikpachuwo fon wawa wana he wa nji Yahuda ran, ritu no no wa nji Israila no wa ti huu riwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />I a he meme ti riwa wa nji Yahuda nye a ngɨzhi ndindi ti ye ri wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran nga i iku ighiren mba nye ngiji ndindi fe ye ri wawa wana he wa nji Yahuda ran to dindi fe nyi ri he ri vi ri wa ikpa wa nji Yahuda wa kabru ri Izhi ri he ri se?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikpachuwo wawa wa roan he wa Nji Yahuda ran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Zizan me tre ri yi wawa bi ran he wa nji Yahuda rana nye. Riwa ame me he vren ri la tre Izhi nye ri wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran, me kpon ngawon ri ndu won nyi. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Ritu ti nganyi me bre Izhi riwa me to no wa nji won Iarala no wa to nganyi riwa rinyi no no wa no wa kpa wari mba chuwo. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Ritu riwa wa kamba ri wa, he kpan fu Izhi ka kɨma ti kpan wan. Ingye nye ari he i wa kpa wa?Ari he vɨri ri nyu kuu! <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Inde wa kɨma vi mkpon jujuyimo ri wa wa ti ri iwɨlo kpi riwa a gbuchi wiri iwawu ri wa ka-u no Izhi ka kɨma-u dzi nye mba i wa kɨma jinja konkron nye dzi ri Izhi ka hu ri wa wo konkron nye wa kɨma dzi ri Izhi nye mba. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Riwa wa tsen wo konkron zetu wari bibi riwa wa ran imba wari ban wo konkron zhu ri ji wari lo gran ri wa, biyi wawa bi ran he wa nji Yahuda ran bibi wo konkron ri ji nye bi he biyi nye wa kayi kabru ri nchi konkron a wato nji Yahuda wawa bi fe ndindi fe riwa Izhi ri tu mba. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Ritu ngamba ran kpo ngambi ritu bi to ka bi han wo konkron riwa wa tsen wa ran bi kpo ngambi, bi ka taka ri a ran he nchi konkron a nye ri yo sron ri yi ran tsede biyi nye bi yo sron riwu. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ama wu to tre ri ri,&lt;&lt;Ai wa tsen wa wo konkron nyi ritu wari fe nkon kawen kabru ri nchi wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />A he ngamba nye! Ama a ga ritu ka-yosron nye wa tsen wa zhu ri ichi mba nga a wu ritu yo sron nye wu fe nkon ri ri son ri tu nchi wan ritu ngamba ran kpo ngawen ran, mamako ngamba, ti sisiri. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Inde Izhi ran ka wo konkron-a wawa wawa nye wa nchi wan ran a wu ngawen ara ri ka-u chuwo ran. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Rinyi nye ki to bibi riwa a he Izhi he ri ndindi ti nga yaa wawa wa joku nye ari no wa yaa ama a tsro ndiditi wan ri wu ritu riwu son ngamba ran, a wu ngawen wa tsen-u Zho ri nchi konkron-a <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />I wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran wa ran ban kusi ka yosron mba ran, wa kawa kabru ri nchi konkron-a. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Biyi wawa bi ran he wa nji Yahuda ran, ran de bi he ka konkron zetu ri ji riwa kugon riwa wa tsen wari logran ri wa mba konkron zetu riwa wa ron-u ikya nyi riwa wa ti wa ran ti-u tsra rinkon riwa wa lo gran ri wa konkron zetu riwa wa ron ari he kya ri huwri ban ri Izhi ran bru ka wo konkrone ngaa ri kpa wan riwa wawu nye he ri kpunji wan.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izhi ri to lo sron ko ngaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Imiri vayi won, me ran ri wa noyi hon to nchi kuanyi ran ritu no yi ran he wa sen tu mgbemgben sron fe nghɨma Israila harri ikigbu wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran wawa wa gra ri Izhi ri sho. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ri ngamba wa kpa wa nji Israila chuwo iwawu. Bibi riwa a he rimi ngaa ri mbe Izhi ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;&lt;Inji riwa ari kpa nji chuwo ri zhu ri Siyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">ari dzu ka hu tre Izhi zho rɨme sron Yakubu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Rinyi nye he tre won riwa me ka dzi ri wa ri vi riwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">me ban meme ti mbi zho.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Wa nji Yahuda wa he wawa wa kpanfu ri Izhi ritu tre raro riwa wa wo, ri nyi he wa nji wawa Izhi ri nyime wa vi nyi he i tu wa ti wati mba nye. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Ritu ide riwa Izhi ri de nga yo wan wa ran he riwa Izhi ri sran wa ran. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ri sen biyi bi ran he wa nji Yahuda ran biyi bi he wa wa ka wo tre Izhi nye ama dzidzan bi fe kpa chuwo ritu ikawo tre wa nji Yahuda. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Bibi wan nye wa nji Yahuda wa he wa ka wo tre Izhi zizan rinyi he ritu no wa fe kpachuwo zhu riwa Izhi riwa a tsro yi. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Ritu Izhi kɨma nji iwa ti ka wawa wa he ri tra tren ritu ka-wo tre. A ti nganyi riwa ari tsro losron ri ko ngaa.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igbibre ri Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Kpunji iron, to, riwa Izhi nga kpansi wan ran yi tu ran! Wa bla tre wan wa han ri wa wa nghɨren nchi wa wa kyawa wawa ari ti wa hon to! <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />&lt;&lt;Ingaa to sron Bachi dzari? Ingaa he kpan tre wan dzari? <verse eid="ROM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Ingaa no Izhi kyari dzari riwa ari he no Izhi no bru ka no?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Wawu nye ti ko ngye nga kyawa wanyi wawu wa he zhu hi ri kre wan, No nkpen he wa ma! No he ngamba.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Ison Rimi Ndu Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ringamba biyi miri vayi, ritu nchon losron Izhi ri ta me bre yi: ka ngambi no Izhi iwawu ka ide ri wu, yo sron mbi rimi ndu wan nga no sisron. Rinyi nye he gbre ri kpunji riwa a he no yi ti. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ran ban tu mbi ka bi he wa mgbumgblume nyi ran, ama no Izhi no sran yi rimi sron mbi ran sran sron mbi. Imba nye bi to ti Izhi nga kya riwa a bi nga bi ri si-u sron nga ran tsra.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Ngha ritu de riwa Izhi ka no wen me la kongaa rimi mbi: Ran tika ritu ngambi bran han bibi riwa a he no yi ti ran. tsede bi ka tika ran tsra, nga bi ri bla ri ngambi ri bibi yosron riwa Izhi ka no yi. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Ki he ri gbre kigbu rimi kpa riri, nga ko gbre ritan he ri ndu wan. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Ri ngamba nye, ko ri riwa ki kigbu, ki he kpa riri rimi kabrutu ri Kristo, nga ki nga ri ngambu ka igbirekankan rimi kpa riri. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Ngamba a he riwa ki ti ndu ide kankankan ka bibi ndindi ti riwa Izhi kano ta. Ka ide mbu he riwa ki tre tre Izhi nye, ki ti-u tsra ri bibi yosron riwa ki he ri wu; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />ka a he riwa ki ti ndu nye, ki ka ti ndu; ka a he riwa ki tsro nye ki ka tsro; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />ka ide mbu he riwa ki nghɨron wari nye, kika ti-u. Inji riwa ari de kyari ka de ri sron riri; nji riwa a he ri gbengbren no ti ndu ri senkpa; nji riwa a tsro reresron ri wari no ti-u ri srom riri.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />No Nyime no he kpunji. Ka mbi ri kya riwa a he meme, bi ri vu kya riwa a bi. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Nyime ngambi bran ka wa hu Izhi, nga bi ri no ngambi mkpen. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ti ndu bran nga bi ri ran ti sankon ran. Hu Izhi ri sron riri. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />No yosron mbi no no yi kinklan sron, vu sron rimi kongye riwa ari kpa sron mbi time, nga bi ri ran bre Izhi ran bla vi. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ga wa kpi mbi ri mgbrombi wa hu Izhi, nga bi ri kpa tsren ri ko mbi.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Bre Izhi no tilibu sro wawa wa no yi yaa; ran la nyun ri wa ran. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Ti kinklan sron ri wawa wa ti kinklan sron, nga bi ri ti shnji sron ri wawa wa ti shnji sron. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Kima ngambi he riri ri ko nga. Ran nzu tu ran, ama he ri reresron. Ran ban tu wen ri wu he ri wiwiri ran. <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Ka injo ti meme ti ri wu, ran ti meme ti zhula ri wu ran. Ti kongye riwa konga ri tre ri a bi. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ti kongye bibi riwa bi kii ri sikpa ri konga. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Wa kpan won, ran ti kya zhula ran, tsede no fu Izhi no ti-u ri wu. Ritu Imbe Izhi tre ri, &lt;&lt;Bachi a tre ri wawu ri ti zhula, wawu ri han zhula.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Tsede, bibi riwa imbe Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;I wa kpan fu wen iyon ri ti wa, wuka no wa ri; ka ilama ti wa, no wa ima no wa so; ritu i wu ti nganyi wu no shan ti wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Ran no meme ti no dzan gbengbren wen ran; tsede wu han gbengbren meme ti ri ndindi ti.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">No Wa Kpanchi Mkpen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Konga no hu tre wa rinkon meme gbu, ritu wa rinkon meme gbu wa ran he ran Izhi ran no wa no wa he ran, nga Izhi nye ka wa dzi ri bubu wan. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Inji riwa a ran hu tre wa rinkon meme gbu ran a kawan ri hu kya riwa Izhi tre; nga nji riwa a ti ngamba, ari ngɨzhi bla tre Izhi ye ri ngawan. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Wawa wa ti ndindi ti wa ran ti sisiri wa kpanchi ran, ama wawa wa ti meme ti wa ti sisiri mba. Wu wa wuri ran ti sisiri wawa wa ri kpanchi ran? Ngamba wu ka ti kya riwa a bi nga wa gbre yi, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />ritu wa he wa ndu Izhi wari ri ti ndu ritu mbi. Ama i bi ti meme ti wuka ti sisiri mba, ritu wa he ri gbengbren ri de yaa. Wa he wa ndu Izhi nga wa he ri gbengbren Izhi riwa wa no wawa wa ti meme ti yaa. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ritu nganyi bi hu tre wa kpanchi, a ran ritu yaa Izhi kakre ran, ama ritu rimiren. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ritu ngamba nye ngawen bi han nkren ri meme, ritu wa kpanchi wa ti ndu ri Izhi nye ka wa kre ndu mba. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Han wa, ikya riwa wa hu-u; han wa nkren ri meme riwa wa kpi wen, he ri rere nga bi ri no wa nkpen wawu.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bibi riwa ki ti Ndu ri Nghambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />No wa ran hu-u kya riri ran, ikya riwa no wa hu-u no he bi nyime ngambi. Inji riwa a ti rinyi a hu tre doka nye mba. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Doka Izhi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ran kru waa njo ran; ran wuu nji ran; ran yibi ran; ran ti mbye kya njo ran&gt;&gt;wawu kyawa wa nyi, nga mgbron wari wa ka wa kabru rimi doka riri riwa a tre ri, &lt;&lt;Nyime kukpan wen bibi riwa wu nyime ngawen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />I wu nyime wari, wu ran ti meme ti ri wa ran; Ka wu nyime, a he ri wu hu doka wawu nye mba.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />A he riwa wu ti kyawa wanyi, ritu wu to ri ivi yee riwa bi shime ri nna mbi. Ritu ivi ri kpata chuwo a ye hyure zizan riwa a he riwa ki gbuchi kpanyime. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Ichu gon ri kre ron, imbiregon ri kpan. No ta ki ka kyawa wawa wa he wa bu rega, nga no ta ki vu kpi kuu riwa ki wanyu ri kpan. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />No ta ki milan ngambu ki, ka wa nji wawa wa ki rimi kpan wulu ri zhi riwa ibuu ran he ran, intɨran ko ka iwanyu imba ti hu ran he ri ran. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ama bi ban kpi riwa Bachi Yeso Kristo, nga bi ri ka sren ton ri meme ti mbi ri kpa nga bi ri no kya ri mbye riwa ari wa.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Ran Bla tre ri vayi wen ran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Biyi kpa nji riwa yosron wan ran senkpa ran, ama ran wa wa ri yɨba si ran i irimiren wan ran he riri ri wa mbi ran. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Iyosro nji wa ri to no wa ri kya riwa a bi ri wa, ama nji riwa yosron wan ran senkpa ran ara nvunvu nye ari ri. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Inji riwa a ri ri ko ri ri bibitan no ran tsri njo riwa a ran ri ri ndandan ran, no ran tre riwa ari ri ndandan-a ri a yɨba si ran, ritu Izhi kpa-e.<verse eid="ROM 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />A wu ngan riwa wu bla tre ri gran njo ri a yɨba si ko gran ti ndu ndin a, ko a ran ti tsra ran a, rimba he tre nji ri ko wan nye wausu ri ri mgbe wan ritu Bachi ri to no no ri mgbe.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Inji ri ye ka to ri ivi ri bi han mgbron vi wari, ama ri to nji ri wa ivi wawu wa he bibi riri nye ko ngan ri fe wama rimi sron wan, <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Inji riwa ari to vi tinkan ari ti ngamba ritu no Bachi mkpen, nji riwa ari ri ndandan ari ti ngamba ritu riwa ari no Bachi mkpen ritu ari ngiri ri Izhi ritu ri-a, nji riwa a ran ri ri ndandan-a ran ari ti ngamba ritu riwa ari no Bachi mkpen nye ritu wawu ngawen ri ye ka ye ngiri ri Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Rimi mbu injo ran ri he ritu ngawan ri kakshi wan ran ara ritu tu wan nye ari kuu ran. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />I ki he ritu Bachi nye, ki he i a he kuu nye ki ti ritu Bachi nye ki kuu, ritu ngamba ko ki he nye ko kuu kita ki he wa Bachi nye. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Ritu Kristo kuu ran tashme ri vri ritu a he Bachi wawa wa kuu ri wawa wa ri sii. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />A wu fa ingye ti ko wuto vayi wen ri kunyiren nga a wu ingye ti ko wu tsiri vayi wen, wawu mbu ki ki kusi Izhi riwa wawu nye ri bla tre ri ta. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />A he rimi ngan riwa Bachi a tre ri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;&lt;Bachi tre ri, riwa me he,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">ko mgbazhu ritan ri kɨbu ri meme kusi won.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />To ko ngan rimi mbu ri bla kya riwa a ti kusi Izhi.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ran no vayi wen no kɨbu dza ran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ritu ngamba no ta ki ka ya ku nyiren ngambu chuwo iki ti ngamba a he riwa ko ngha ka yosron riwa a ran he nji riwa ari no vayi wan joku ka no ti meme ti ran. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Me to me he ri yosron bran bran rimi Bachi Yeso ri ikya ri ran he riwa a he riwa a he ri sisiri ran ritu wan ama injo ban ri a he kya riwa a ran he ri tsitsri ran to riwu nye a ran he ri tsitsri ran. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />I wu kpa sron vayi wen ri time ritu iri riwa wu ri, ka a ran he inyime nye wu tsro ran nye mba. Ran no ri riwa wu ri no he nkon ri wa wu kpa vayi wen riwa Kristo kuu itu time ran. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ran no kya riwa a tsra riwu ri to wen no he kya riwa a ran bi ri wari ran.<verse eid="ROM 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Ritu kpanchison Izhi ran he ri nga so ran, a he tre ri ti tsra nye ri son ri sisron ri kinklan sron rimi Yuu ri Tsitsri.<verse eid="ROM 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Ngha i nji riwa ari tindu ri Kristo dzu i nkon nyi ari he nji riwa nji wa nyiem-u. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ritu ngmba no ta ki ti kya riwa ki to ti kiri ti kya riwa ari ngiji son ri sikpa ye nga nghɨron ngambu. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Ran dzi ndu Izhi ritu tre ri la lele wa to ri ko bibi ri ri bibi tan. Ama a ran he kya ri bi ran i iri riwa wa ri nye ri no wari no wa joku ran <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />A bi han riwa wuran tan nɨma ran ko ka wu so ima i a bi ka wu ti ko ngye riwa ari no vayi wen no yɨba si. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />No tre riwa wu he ri wu ritu shan nyi no he ri tsutsu wen imbi Izhi ndindi ti ri he wanji riwa isron wan ranno ti meme ti ran ritu kya riwa wawu ritu wan ban ri a tsra! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ama nji riwa a he ri rimiren hari ritu kya riwa ari ri ka a ngiji fu Izhi ri ye ri ngawan nye, i ari ritu izren wan riwa ari zren a ran yosron rimi kpanyime ran, nga nji riwa a ran yo sron ri kpa nyime ran a he meme ti nye.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Ti kya riwa ari si wari sron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Kita wawa ki he ri senkpa rimi yosron mbu a he riwa ki ban yaa wawa wa ran senkpa ran ritu riwa ki zon wa rimi ku nyiren mba ki ran tsro ri sentu ran. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />No ko ngan rimi mbu no si vayi wan sron ritu ampani wan nga ri me ri yosron wan. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Ritu ko Kristo ngawen a ran si ngawan sron ran bibi riwa a he rimi ngan ri,&lt;&lt;Wa kratu riwa wa kra-u wa ku ri tu won.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Ikya riwa wa ngaa dzi tu sisenmu ri ngaa mbe Izhi wa ngaa nye riwa ari tsro ta riu no ta ki he wa yon sron zhu ri vu sron kri mgbemgben ri wawa itre Izhi ri ye kaye no ta. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />No Izhi riwa ari de vu sron nga mgbemgben sron no ngizhi yi hi zhu rimi bibi riwa bi kpanyime ri ngambi bi hu bibi riwa Kriso Yeso. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Ri ngamba nye wawumbi bi he ri nyu riri, ri tre riri, riwa bi gbre Izhi riwa wawu nye he A ti Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itre ri ro ri wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Bi kpa ngambi wo hari bibi riwa Kristo kpa wo hari ritu no yi no nji no wa no Izhi mkpen. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Ame me layi ri ritu kya riwa Kristo he nyi a ti ndu ri wa nji Yahuda ritu no wa tsro kpunji tre riwa Izhi nga wari to ika tredzi riwa wa ti-u ri wa ti wati mba, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />ritu wawa wana he wa nji Yahuda ran no wa gbre Izhi ritu ikpanji chuwo wan Bibi riwa a he rimi ngaa ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">&lt;&lt;Ritu nganyi me gbre wu rimi wawa wana he nji Yahuda ran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">me chu se ritu gbresan wen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Itre Izhi riwa wa ngaa a bru tre ri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">&lt;&lt;Biyi wawa bi ran he wa nji Yahuda ran ti kinklan sron ri wa nji Izhi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Wa ngaa sron ngaa ri,&lt;&lt;Gbre Bachi wawu biyi riwa bi ran he nji Yahuda ran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">gbre wu san biyi wa rɨme kankankan iwawu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Ngha Ishaya tre ri,&lt;&lt;Inji ri rimi nkon wa Jesse ri zhu ari wulunde ran he chu wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">wu nye wawa wa ran he Wa nji Yahuda ran wa yo sron.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />No Izhi riwa ari ngiji yo sisron ye no no yi kinklan sron bran ri no piyan ri vi riwa bi yo sron ri wu ri ngamba bi he ri yo sron bran dzu riwo wu ri tsitsri.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu Bulus ri wawa wana he wa nji Yahuda ran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Imiri vayi won ame ri tu won me kpa nyime ri biyi ri tumbi bi he ri ndindi ti nga bi ri he ri ito bran, hari bi ke riwa bi tsro ngambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Rimi ngha won nyi me zhu rira bran meri ri layi bran ritu kyawa wari riwa me taka ri yi me ti rinyi ritu iti ndindi riwa Izhi ti ri mon, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />riwa wawu Izhi nye no wen me tindu ri Kristo Yeso ri wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran. Ti tindu bibi ndu wa de zhu ri la tre ri raro riwa Izhi ritu riwa wari wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran no wa he ide riwa Izhi ri kpa wa wawa wa tsri wa dzu riwo Yuu Tsitsri,<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ritu nganyi me to chonkpon rimi Kristo Yeso ritu ndu riwa me ti ri Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Me ran vu sron me ri tre tre ritu kya ri ran tse de ritu kya riwa Kristo ti dzu ri me ikya nyi nye he bibi riwa wa ngizhi wawa wa ran he wa nji Yahuda ran ye no wa kpa tre Izhi dzu ri wa tre won nga wa ndu won, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />Zhu riwa gbengbren ri bibi wa kyawa riwa wa de sisiri wawu mba wa zhu rimi Yuu Izhi nye. Wato zhu ri Urushelima riwa a he kagon hi ri bubu riwa tre ndu wawu. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ko shitan yosron won he ri no wen tre tre riwa a ro-a ri bubu riwa wana to Kristo ran ritu ri no ran he me mme ri tu nchi tra riwa injo ri nkan nye zi nchi wan. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Bibi riwa imbe zhi tre ri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">&lt;&lt;Wawa wana tre ri wa ran wa to,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">nga wawa wara wo ran wa to tu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a wa nkon ri hi gbu Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />wa n ndun yen ti ko imkpa kigbu riwa wa dzu wen ri ye ri yi. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Zizan nye me kre ndu won ri bubu nyi riwa me he riwa a he riwa ise kigbu riwa me wa meri ye ri yi riwa meri to yi. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Me milan ngawon ti riwa me ye ri yi zizan me bre iri ri vi riwa me ka hi ri meme Asbaiya me hu ri yi me bi i me to ro son ri yi ri vi tsawen me hi ku ri kusi ri zon mbi. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ama zizan me hi Urushelima riwa me ngɨzhi zon hi no wawa wa tsiri wa ri bubu wan <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Wa nji wa hu Izhi wawa wa he ri meme Makidoniya ri wawa wa he ri Akaya wa to ro de riwa wa no wawa wa ran he ri kyari ran riwa tsitsiri-a ri Urishelima. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Wa to ro ti ngamba ko riwa a he lele ri wa ritu a he ndu nye ri tu mba nye wawa wana he wa nji Yahuda ran wa fe tilibu riwa Yuu ri wa nji Yahuda a he riwa ka wa ri llaa nye ri tindu ri tilibu mba ri mgbumgblume ritu no wa no wa nji Yahuda riwa wa wa. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ka me kre ndu nyi, nga me ka nkren riwa wa no wen-a wawu, ka me hi ri Sipen me hu ri yi ka me hi ri bubu wan. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ka me ye ri yi, me to ri me ye ri yi ri tilɨbu riwa Kristo bran. <verse eid="ROM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Me bre yi miri vayi won, ritu Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo, ri nyime riwa Yuu Tsitsri de: dzon wen rimi bre Izhi ritu won. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Bre ritu meri fe son sisron ri wo wawa wa wa ran hu Izhi ran ri gbu Judiya nga no ndu won ri Urishelima no wa hu Izhi no wa kpa ri bubu wan. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Nga me ye ri yi ri kinklan sron, ka Izhi nyime, no ye won ri yi no he kya ri si sron. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />No Izhi riwa wawu nye ri de sisron, no he ri yi wawu. No he ngamba.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Ichi Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Me tru vayi mbu Fibi ri ye ri yi ri wa me layi tre wan ri a he wa ri lo sron. Wawu he wa riwa ari zon wawa wa hu Izhi ri kan kiriya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Kpa rimi nde Bachi bibi riwa nabi no wa ka wa tsitsri bi ri no bibi dzon riwa ari yi ritu wawu ri towa zon wa nji kigbu nga ame ngawen. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Bi chi Briskila mba Akila wa kpan ndu won rimi Kristo Yeso <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Wawa wa ka sron mba de ka wa kuu ri tu won. A ran he ame ri kankshe won nye me ngiri ri wa ran hari ri mgbiron wa nji wa hu Izhi wawa wana he wa nji Yahuda ran. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Bi chi wa nji wa hu Izhi wawa wa kabru ri ko mba <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Bi chi Meremu riwa a so yaa ri ndu bran ri tu mbi. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Bi chi Andaronikus nga Yuniya wawa Yahuda nye ka ame, wawa wa lo wa ri tra tren riri me wawa wa wanji wawa wa to wa bran bran rimi wa ta tre Izhi nga wa gbuchi kpa tre Izhi ri rimi Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Bi chi Amfiliyatus ikpan won ri kpunji rimi kabrutu ri Bachi. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Bi chi Urbanus ikpan ndu mbu rimi ndu Kristo, nga kpan won Sitakis. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Bi chi Afalis riwa inyime wan rimi Kristo he njiaji bi ka chi wa ko Aristobulus.<verse eid="ROM 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Bi ka chi Hirudiyan riwa wawu nye he nji Yahuda bi chi wawa wa he rimi Bachi rimi ko Narkisus.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Bi ka chi Tiryifina nga tirayifusa imba wa nyi wa wa wa so yaa rimi ndu Bachi bi ri chi Farisa ikpan won ri wa me nyimeu, riwa a so yaa rimi ndu bran ritu Bachi. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Bi ka chi Rufus riwa wa to rimi Bachi bi ri chi iyi wan riwa a ban wen ka me he vren wan. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Bi ka chi Asinkiritus, nga Filigona, ri Harmis, ri Foturobas, ri Harmas ri wa miri vayi wawa wa he iwawa. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Bi ka chi Filologus ngaYulia, nga Niriyus mba vayi wan vruwa, nga Olimfas nga wa hu Izhi wawu wawa wa he ri wa. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Chi ngambi ri bibi chi riwa wa hu Izhi. Wa hu Izhi wawu wa chi yi.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ide Tre Bulus ri kremkpen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Me bre yi biyi wa miri vayi won: milan ya wawa wa ga yi nga wari kpa yosron nji pisi nga wari kamba ri tsro riwa bi kpa. Kima ngambi zho ri wa. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Ritu wawa wa ti bibi mba wa ran ri hu Bachi mbu Kristo ran, ama wa hu mbiye mba. Wa gyuru nji wawa wa ran to kya ran ri tre mba ndindi nga tre ri raro. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Ko ngaa wo bibi riwa bi hu tre Izhi, nga ritu nganyi me ti kinklan sron ritu mbi. Me no yi he ri wiwiri ritu kya riwa a bi, ama bi ri kambi ri kya riwa a meme. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Ngha Izhi riwa wawu nye ri de sisron, ari chan meme nji yo ri ndodza mbi. No ndindi ti Bachi mbu Yeso no he ri yi. <verse eid="ROM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Ikpan ndu won Timoti, nga Lushiyus, Yason nga Sosifata wawa wa he wa nji Yahuda wa hu ngawen wa chi yi. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Ame Tartiyus, riwa Bulus a no wen me ngan mbe nyi, me chi yi bibi wa wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayus riwa wawu nye a kpa wen yo ri ko wan, nga wawu nye wa hu Izhi wa kabrutu ri ko wan, wawu ngawen ri chi yi; Erastus, nji ri dzi nkren ri gbu, nga vayi mbu Kwartu wa chi yi ngawen. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />No ndindi ti Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo No he ri yi wawu. No he ngamba.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikre Bre Izhi ri Gbre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />No ta ki no Izhi mkpen! Wawu he ri gbengbren riwa ari no ta ki ki mgbemgben rimi yosron mbi, bibi riwa tre ri ro riwa me la ritu Yeso Kristo nga bibi riwa nghɨran nchi yayibi ri kpunji riwa wa ka-u ri dzi sesenmu. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Zizan, wa nghɨran kpunji-a zhu ri raa hu ri ngan wa la tre Izhi; nga itre Izhi riwa a ran kre ran-a nye la mgbumgblume wawu, ritu no <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Ki gbre Izhi nkankshe wan riwa wawu ka kre he ri wiwiri hu ri Yeso Kristo hi ri kre! No he ngamba.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>